rs them by category.\",\"difficulty\":\"Easy\",\"type\":\"backend\",\"detail\":{\"id\":33,\"question_id\":33,\"constraints\":\"GET /products should return all products. A category query parameter should return only matching products.\",\"expected_approach\":\"Read the category query parameter and filter the products when it is provided.\",\"expected_complexity\":\"\",\"ideal_answer\":\"\",\"scenario\":\"\",\"correct_option\":\"\",\"explanation\":\"\",\"created_at\":\"2026-09-17T08:02:22.761Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-09-17T08:02:22.761Z\"},\"test_cases\":[{\"id\":25,\"question_id\":33,\"input\":\"GET /products\",\"expected_output\":\"200 [{\\\"id\\\":1,\\\"name\\\":\\\"Laptop\\\",\\\"category\\\":\\\"Electronics\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":2,\\\"name\\\":\\\"Chair\\\",\\\"category\\\":\\\"Furniture\\\"}]\",\"is_hidden\":false,\"explanation\":\"\",\"order_index\":1,\"created_at\":\"2026-09-17T08:02:22.769Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-09-17T08:02:22.769Z\"},{\"id\":26,\"question_id\":33,\"input\":\"GET /products?category=Electronics\",\"expected_output\":\"200 [{\\\"id\\\":1,\\\"name\\\":\\\"Laptop\\\",\\\"category\\\":\\\"Electronics\\\"}]\",\"is_hidden\":true,\"explanation\":\"\",\"order_index\":2,\"created_at\":\"2026-09-17T08:02:22.771Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-09-17T08:02:22.771Z\"}],\"hints\":[{\"id\":78,\"question_id\":33,\"type\":\"hint\",\"content\":\"Use filter() when a category is provided.\",\"order_index\":1,\"created_at\":\"2026-09-17T08:02:22.775Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-09-17T08:02:22.775Z\"}],\"created_at\":\"2026-09-17T08:02:22.76Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-09-17T08:02:22.76Z\"},{\"id\":34,\"level_id\":10,\"title\":\"Update User\",\"prompt\":\"Implement a REST API that updates the name of an existing user.\",\"difficulty\":\"Easy\",\"type\":\"backend\",\"detail\":{\"id\":34,\"question_id\":34,\"constraints\":\"Use PATCH /users/:id. Return HTTP 200 after a successful update and HTTP 404 when the user does not exist.\",\"expected_approach\":\"Find the user by ID and update the name using the request body.\",\"expected_complexity\":\"\",\"ideal_answer\":\"\",\"scenario\":\"\",\"correct_option\":\"\",\"explanation\":\"\",\"created_at\":\"2026-09-17T08:02:22.804Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-09-17T08:02:22.804Z\"},\"test_cases\":[{\"id\":27,\"question_id\":34,\"input\":\"PATCH /users/1 {\\\"name\\\":\\\"John\\\"}\",\"expected_output\":\"200 {\\\"id\\\":1,\\\"name\\\":\\\"John\\\"}\",\"is_hidden\":false,\"explanation\":\"\",\"order_index\":1,\"created_at\":\"2026-09-17T08:02:22.809Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-09-17T08:02:22.809Z\"},{\"id\":28,\"question_id\":34,\"input\":\"PATCH /users/99 {\\\"name\\\":\\\"John\\\"}\",\"expected_output\":\"404 {\\\"error\\\":\\\"User not found\\\"}\",\"is_hidden\":true,\"explanation\":\"\",\"order_index\":2,\"created_at\":\"2026-09-17T08:02:22.81Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-09-17T08:02:22.81Z\"}],\"hints\":[{\"id\":79,\"question_id\":34,\"type\":\"hint\",\"content\":\"Find the user first, then update its name.\",\"order_index\":1,\"created_at\":\"2026-09-17T08:02:22.811Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-09-17T08:02:22.811Z\"}],\"created_at\":\"2026-09-17T08:02:22.802Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-09-17T08:02:22.802Z\"},{\"id\":35,\"level_id\":10,\"title\":\"Delete Task\",\"prompt\":\"Implement a REST API that deletes a task using its ID.\",\"difficulty\":\"Easy\",\"type\":\"backend\",\"detail\":{\"id\":35,\"question_id\":35,\"constraints\":\"Use DELETE /tasks/:id. Return HTTP 200 when the task is deleted and HTTP 404 when the task does not exist.\",\"expected_approach\":\"Find the task by ID and remove it from the list.\",\"expected_complexity\":\"\",\"ideal_answer\":\"\",\"scenario\":\"\",\"correct_option\":\"\",\"explanation\":\"\",\"created_at\":\"2026-09-17T08:02:22.844Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-09-17T08:02:22.844Z\"},\"test_cases\":[{\"id\":29,\"question_id\":35,\"input\":\"DELETE /tasks/1\",\"expected_output\":\"200 {\\\"message\\\":\\\"Task deleted\\\"}\",\"is_hidden\":false,\"explanation\":\"\",\"order_index\":1,\"created_at\":\"2026-09-17T08:02:22.848Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-09-17T08:02:22.848Z\"},{\"id\":30,\"question_id\":35,\"input\":\"DELETE /tasks/99\",\"expected_output\":\"404 {\\\"error\\\":\\\"Task not found\\\"}\",\"is_hidden\":true,\"explanation\":\"\",\"order_index\":2,\"created_at\":\"2026-09-17T08:02:22.853Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-09-17T08:02:22.853Z\"}],\"hints\":[{\"id\":80,\"question_id\":35,\"type\":\"hint\",\"content\":\"Find the task and remove it from the list.\",\"order_index\":1,\"created_at\":\"2026-09-17T08:02:22.854Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-09-17T08:02:22.854Z\"}],\"created_at\":\"2026-09-17T08:02:22.843Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-09-17T08:02:22.843Z\"}],\"status\":\"success\"}','','2026-09-17 08:26:44.683'),(385,2,'admin@bitsathy.ac.in','System Administrator','admin','GET','/api/v1/admin/interviews/tracks/5/levels','','2a09:bac1:36c0:128::2a7:70','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/153.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',200,4,'','{\"data\":[{\"id\":10,\"track_id\":5,\"level_number\":1,\"name\":\"API Design \\u0026 Middleware Auth\",\"description\":\"CRUD endpoint design, JWT auth middleware, and error handling\",\"mode\":\"backend\",\"duration_minutes\":45,\"question_count\":1,\"created_at\":\"2026-09-17T07:44:11Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-09-17T07:56:26.479Z\",\"questions_count\":5},{\"id\":11,\"track_id\":5,\"level_number\":2,\"name\":\"Concurrency \\u0026 Resilient Services\",\"description\":\"Goroutines/threads, Redis caching, worker pools, and rate limiting\",\"mode\":\"backend\",\"duration_minutes\":50,\"question_count\":1,\"created_at\":\"2026-09-17T07:44:11Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-09-17T07:56:35.889Z\",\"questions_count\":0}],\"status\":\"success\"}','','2026-09-17 08:26:45.515'),(386,2,'admin@bitsathy.ac.in','System Administrator','admin','GET','/api/v1/admin/interviews/tracks/5','','2a09:bac1:36c0:128::2a7:70','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/153.0.0.0 