"mode\":\"verbal_qa\",\"duration_minutes\":30,\"question_count\":5,\"created_at\":\"2026-09-17T07:44:11Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-09-17T07:56:55.016Z\",\"questions_count\":0},{\"id\":15,\"track_id\":7,\"level_number\":2,\"name\":\"Leadership \\u0026 Conflict Management\",\"description\":\"Cross-team communication, mentorship, and technical decision making\",\"mode\":\"verbal_qa\",\"duration_minutes\":40,\"question_count\":5,\"created_at\":\"2026-09-17T07:44:11Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-09-17T07:56:59.115Z\",\"questions_count\":0}],\"status\":\"success\"}','','2026-09-17 08:28:58.260'),(419,2,'admin@bitsathy.ac.in','System Administrator','admin','GET','/api/v1/admin/interviews/levels/14/questions','','2a09:bac1:36c0:128::2a7:70','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/153.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',200,2,'','{\"data\":[],\"status\":\"success\"}','','2026-09-17 08:29:01.479'),(420,2,'admin@bitsathy.ac.in','System Administrator','admin','GET','/api/v1/admin/interviews/levels/14','','2a09:bac1:36c0:128::2a7:70','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/153.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',200,5,'','{\"data\":{\"created_at\":\"2026-09-17T07:44:11Z\",\"description\":\"Describe past project challenges, teamwork, and deliverables under pressure\",\"duration_minutes\":30,\"id\":14,\"level_number\":1,\"mode\":\"verbal_qa\",\"name\":\"Situational \\u0026 STAR Format Q\\u0026A\",\"question_count\":5,\"questions_count\":0,\"track_id\":7,\"updated_at\":\"2026-09-17T07:56:55.016Z\"},\"status\":\"success\"}','','2026-09-17 08:29:01.478'),(421,2,'admin@bitsathy.ac.in','System Administrator','admin','GET','/api/v1/admin/interviews/tracks/7','','2a09:bac1:36c0:128::2a7:70','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/153.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',200,6,'','{\"data\":{\"category\":\"HR \\u0026 Soft Skills\",\"created_at\":\"2026-09-17T07:43:11Z\",\"description\":\"STAR format behavioral inquiries, culture fit, conflict resolution, and leadership principles.\",\"icon\":\"Users\",\"id\":7,\"levels_count\":2,\"questions_count\":0,\"slug\":\"behavioral-leadership\",\"title\":\"Behavioral \\u0026 Leadership\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-09-17T07:43:11Z\"},\"status\":\"success\"}','','2026-09-17 08:29:01.477'),(422,2,'admin@bitsathy.ac.in','System Administrator','admin','POST','/api/v1/admin/interviews/levels/14/questions/bulk','','2a09:bac1:36c0:128::2a7:70','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/153.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',200,336,'{\"questions\":[{\"title\":\"Handling a Team Conflict\",\"prompt\":\"Tell me about a time when you had a disagreement or conflict with a teammate. How did you handle the situation?\",\"difficulty\":\"Easy\",\"type\":\"verbal_qa\",\"detail\":{\"ideal_answer\":\"Use the STAR format: Situation - describe the disagreement briefly. Task - explain your responsibility in resolving it. Action - describe how you listened, communicated calmly, and worked toward a solution. Result - explain how the conflict was resolved and what you learned.\"},\"hints\":[{\"type\":\"rubric\",\"content\":\"Clearly explains the situation and the candidate\'s role in the conflict.\"},{\"type\":\"rubric\",\"content\":\"Shows active listening, respectful communication, and problem-solving.\"},{\"type\":\"interview_tip\",\"content\":\"Probe the candidate: What would you do differently if the same conflict happened again?\"}],\"level_id\":14},{\"title\":\"Taking Leadership\",\"prompt\":\"Tell me about a time when you took the initiative to lead a task or activity.\",\"difficulty\":\"Easy\",\"type\":\"verbal_qa\",\"detail\":{\"ideal_answer\":\"Use the STAR format: Situation - describe the task or activity. Task - explain why leadership was needed. Action - explain how you organized the team, assigned responsibilities, and kept everyone involved. Result - describe the outcome and what you learned about leadership.\"},\"hints\":[{\"type\":\"rubric\",\"content\":\"Provides a specific example where the candidate voluntarily took responsibility.\"},{\"type\":\"rubric\",\"content\":\"Explains how the candidate coordinated or supported other team members.\"},{\"type\":\"interview_tip\",\"content\":\"Probe the candidate: How did you handle a teammate who was not contributing?\"}],\"level_id\":14},{\"title\":\"Handling Failure\",\"prompt\":\"Tell me about a time when you failed at a task or made a mistake. What did you do afterward?\",\"difficulty\":\"Easy\",\"type\":\"verbal_qa\",\"detail\":{\"ideal_answer\":\"Use the STAR format: Situation - explain the task and what went wrong. Task - describe your responsibility. Action - explain how you accepted the mistake, identified the cause, and took corrective action. Result - describe the outcome and the lesson learned.\"},\"hints\":[{\"type\":\"rubric\",\"content\":\"Takes responsibility instead of blaming others.\"},{\"type\":\"rubric\",\"content\":\"Demonstrates learning and corrective action after the mistake.\"},{\"type\":\"interview_tip\",\"content\":\"Probe the candidate: What specific change did you make after this experience?\"}],\"level_id\":14},{\"title\":\"Working Under Pressure\",\"prompt\":\"Describe a situation where you had to complete an important task under pressure or within a tight deadline.\",\"difficulty\":\"Easy\",\"type\":\"verbal_qa\",\"detail\":{\"ideal_answer\":\"Use the STAR format: Situation - describe the pressure or deadline. Task - explain what needed to be completed. Action - describe how you prioritized work, managed your time, and stayed focused. Result - explain whether you completed the task and what you learned.\"},\"hints\":[{\"type\":\"rubric\",\"content\":\"Explains how priorities were identified and time was managed.\"},{\"type\":\"rubric\",\"content\":\"Shows calm decision-making and focus under pressure.\"},{\"type\":\"interview_tip\",\"content\":\"Probe the candidate: How did you decide what to do first?\"}],\"level_id\":14},{\"title\":\"Helping a Teammate\",\"prompt\":\"Tell me about a time when you helped a teammate who was struggling with a task.\",\"difficulty\":\"Easy\",\"type\":\"verbal_qa\",\"detail\":{\"ideal_answer\":\"Use the STAR format: Situation - explain why the teammate was struggling. Task - describe your role or responsibility. Action - explain how you understood their problem and provided guidance or support. Result - describe how the teammate or team benefited.\"},\"hints\":[{\"type\":\"rubric\",\"content\":\"Shows teamwork, empathy, and willingness to support others.\"},{\"type\":\"rubric\",\"content\":\"Explains how the candidate helped without simply doing the work for the teammate.\"},{\"type\":\"interview_tip\",\"content\":\"Probe the candidate: How did you make sure the teammate understood the solution?\"}],\"level_id\":14},{\"title\":\"Making a Difficult Decision\",\"prompt\":\"Tell me about a time when you had to make a difficult decision. How did you decide what to do?\",\"difficulty\":\"Easy\",\"type\":\"verbal_qa\",\"detail\":{\"ideal_answer\":\"Use the STAR format: Situation - explain the difficult situation. Task - describe the decision you were responsible for. Action - explain how you considered the available options, risks, and consequences. Result - describe the outcome and what you learned.\"},\"hints\":[{\"type\":\"rubric\",\"content\":\"Clearly explains the options and factors considered before making the decision.\"},{\"type\":\"rubric\",\"content\":\"Demonstrates accountability for the final decision.\"},{\"type\":\"interview_tip\",\"content\":\"Probe the candidate: What information was most important when making the decision?\"}],\"level_id\":14},{\"title\":\"Receiving Feedback\",\"prompt\":\"Tell me about a time when you received negative or constructive feedback. How did you respond?\",\"difficulty\":\"Easy\",\"type\":\"verbal_qa\",\"detail\":{\"ideal_answer\":\"Use the STAR format: Situation - describe when you received the feedback. Task - explain what you were responsible for. Action - describe how you listened, understood the feedback, and made improvements. Result - explain how your performance changed afterward.\"},\"hints\":[{\"type\":\"rubric\",\"content\":\"Shows openness to feedback without becoming defensive.\"},{\"type\":\"rubric\",\"content\":\"Provides a specific improvement made based on the feedback.\"},{\"type\":\"interview_tip\",\"content\":\"Probe the candidate: What was the most useful part of the feedback?\"}],\"level_id\":14},{\"title\":\"Adapting to Change\",\"prompt\":\"Describe a time when a plan changed unexpectedly. How did you adapt?\",\"difficulty\":\"Easy\",\"type\":\"verbal_qa\",\"detail\":{\"ideal_answer\":\"Use the STAR format: Situation - explain the original plan and what changed. Task - describe what you still needed to accomplish. Action - explain how you adjusted your approach and communicated the changes. Result - describe the final outcome.\"},\"hints\":[{\"type\":\"rubric\",\"content\":\"Clearly explains the unexpected change and its impact.\"},{\"type\":\"rubric\",\"content\":\"Demonstrates flexibility, problem-solving, and communication.\"},{\"type\":\"interview_tip\",\"content\":\"Probe the candidate: How did you communicate the changed plan to others?\"}],\"level_id\":14},{\"title\":\"Motivating Others\",\"prompt\":\"Tell me about a time when you helped motivate your team to complete an important task.\",\"difficulty\":\"Easy\",\"type\":\"verbal_qa\",\"detail\":{\"ideal_answer\":\"Use the STAR format: Situation - describe why the team was losing motivation. Task - explain your responsibility. Action - describe how you encouraged the team, clarified goals, divided work, or supported teammates. Result - explain how the team\'s motivation and progress improved.\"},\"hints\":[{\"type\":\"rubric\",\"content\":\"Shows positive communication and understanding of team members.\"},{\"type\":\"rubric\",\"content\":\"Explains specific actions taken to improve team motivation.\"},{\"type\":\"interview_tip\",\"content\":\"Probe the candidate: How did you know your approach was working?\"}],\"level_id\":14},{\"title\":\"Taking Responsibility\",\"prompt\":\"Tell me about a time when you were responsible for a problem in a team project. What did you do?\",\"difficulty\":\"Easy\",\"type\":\"verbal_qa\",\"detail\":{\"ideal_answer\":\"Use the STAR format: Situation - explain the team project and the problem. Task - describe your responsibility. Action - explain how you acknowledged the issue, communicated with the team, and worked on a solution. Result - describe the final outcome and what you learned about accountability.\"},\"hints\":[{\"type\":\"rubric\",\"content\":\"Accepts responsibility and avoids blaming teammates.\"},{\"type\":\"rubric\",\"content\":\"Shows ownership, communication, and corrective action.\"},{\"type\":\"interview_tip\",\"content\":\"Probe the candidate: What did you learn about taking ownership from this experience?\"}],\"level_id\":14}]}','{\"created_count\":10,\"data\":[{\"id\":65,\"level_id\":14,\"title\":\"Handling a Team Conflict\",\"prompt\":\"Tell me about a time when you had a disagreement or conflict with a teammate. How did you handle the situation?\",\"difficulty\":\"Easy\",\"type\":\"verbal_qa\",\"created_at\":\"2026-09-17T08:30:41.669Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-09-17T08:30:41.669Z\"},{\"id\":66,\"level_id\":14,\"title\":\"Taking Leadership\",\"prompt\":\"Tell me about a time when you took the initiative to lead a task or activity.\",\"difficulty\":\"Easy\",\"type\":\"verbal_qa\",\"created_at\":\"2026-09-17T08:30:41.714Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-09-17T08:30:41.714Z\"},{\"id\":67,\"level_id\":14,\"title\":\"Handling Failure\",\"prompt\":\"Tell me about a time when you failed at a task or made a mistake. What did you do afterward?\",\"difficulty\":\"Easy\",\"type\":\"verbal_qa\",\"created_at\":\"2026-09-17T08:30:41.748Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-09-17T08:30:41.748Z\"},{\"id\":68,\"level_id\":14,\"title\":\"Working Under Pressure\",\"prompt\":\"Describe a situation where you had to complete an important task under pressure or within a tight deadline.\",\"difficulty\":\"Easy\",\"type\":\"verbal_qa\",\"created_at\":\"2026-09-17T08:30:41.773Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-09-17T08:30:41.773Z\"},{\"id\":69,\"level_id\":14,\"title\":\"Helping a Teammate\",\"prompt\":\"Tell me about a time when you helped a teammate who was struggling with a task.\",\"difficulty\":\"Easy\",\"type\":\"verbal_qa\",\"created_at\":\"2026-09-17T08:30:41.815Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-09-17T08:30:41.815Z\"},{\"id\":70,\"level_id\":14,\"title\":\"Making a Difficult Decision\",\"prompt\":\"Tell me about a time when you had to make a difficult decision. How did you decide what to do?\",\"difficulty\":\"Easy\",\"type\":\"verbal_qa\",\"created_at\":\"2026-09-17T08:30:41.854Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-09-17T08:30:41.854Z\"},{\"id\":71,\"level_id\":14,\"title\":\"Receiving Feedback\",\"prompt\":\"Tell me about a time when you received negative or constructive feedback. How did you respond?\",\"difficulty\":\"Easy\",\"type\":\"verbal_qa\",\"created_at\":\"2026-09-17T08:30:41.886Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-09-17T08:30:41.886Z\"},{\"id\":72,\"level_id\":14,\"title\":\"Adapting to Change\",\"prompt\":\"Describe a time when a plan changed unexpectedly. How did you adapt?\",\"difficulty\":\"Easy\",\"type\":\"verbal_qa\",\"created_at\":\"2026-09-17T08:30:41.915Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-09-17T08:30:41.915Z\"},{\"id\":73,\"level_id\":14,\"title\":\"Motivating Others\",\"prompt\":\"Tell me about a time when you helped motivate your team to complete an important task.\",\"difficulty\":\"Easy\",\"type\":\"verbal_qa\",\"created_at\":\"2026-09-17T08:30:41.943Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-09-17T08:30:41.943Z\"},{\"id\":74,\"level_id\":14,\"title\":\"Taking Responsibility\",\"prompt\":\"Tell me about a time when you were responsible for a problem in a team project. What did you do?\",\"difficulty\":\"Easy\",\"type\":\"verbal_qa\",\"created_at\":\"2026-09-17T08:30:41.971Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-09-17T08:30:41.971Z\"}],\"message\":\"Bulk upload complete: 10 questions created, 0 skipped\",\"skipped_count\":0,\"skipped_details\":null,\"status\":\"success\"}','','2026-09-17 08:30:41.667'),(423,2,'admin@bitsathy.ac.in','System Administrator','admin','GET','/api/v1/admin/interviews/levels/14','','2a09:bac1:36c0:128::2a7:70','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/153.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',200,10,'','{\"data\":{\"created_at\":\"2026-09-17T07:44:11Z\",\"description\":\"Describe past project challenges, teamwork, and deliverables under pressure\",\"duration_minutes\":30,\"id\":14,\"level_number\":1,\"mode\":\"verbal_qa\",\"name\":\"Situational \\u0026 STAR Format Q\\u0026A\",\"question_count\":5,\"questions_count\":10,\"track_id\":7,\"updated_at\":\"2026-09-17T07:56:55.016Z\"},\"status\":\"success\"}','','2026-09-17 08:30:42.144'),(424,2,'admin@bitsathy.ac.in','System Administrator','admin','GET','/api/v1/admin/interviews/tracks/7','','2a09:bac1:36c0:128::2a7:70','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/153.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',200,13,'','{\"data\":{\"category\":\"HR \\u0026 Soft Skills\",\"created_at\":\"2026-09-17T07:43:11Z\",\"description\":\"STAR format behavioral inquiries, culture fit, conflict resolution, and leadership principles.\",\"icon\":\"Users\",\"id\":7,\"levels_count\":2,\"questions_count\":10,\"slug\":\"behavioral-leadership\",\"title\":\"Behavioral \\u0026 Leadership\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-09-17T07:43:11Z\"},\"status\":\"success\"}','','2026-09-17 08:30:42.141'),(425,2,'admin@bitsathy.ac.in','System Administrator','admin','GET','/api/v1/admin/interviews/levels/14/questions','','2a09:bac1:36c0:128::2a7:70','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/153.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',200,26,'','{\"data\":[{\"id\":65,\"level_id\":14,\"title\":\"Handling a Team Conflict\",\"prompt\":\"Tell me about a time when you had a disagreement or conflict with a teammate. How did you handle the situation?\",\"difficulty\":\"Easy\",\"type\":\"verbal_qa\",\"detail\":{\"id\":65,\"question_id\":65,\"constraints\":\"\",\"expected_approach\":\"\",\"expected_complexity\":\"\",\"ideal_answer\":\"Use the STAR format: Situation - describe the disagreement briefly. Task - explain your responsibility in resolving it. Action - describe how you listened, communicated calmly, and worked toward a solution. Result - explain how the conflict was resolved and what you learned.\",\"scenario\":\"\",\"correct_option\":\"\",\"explanation\":\"\",\"created_at\":\"2026-09-17T08:30:41.67Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-09-17T08:30:41.67Z\"},\"hints\":[{\"id\":110,\"question_id\":65,\"type\":\"rubric\",\"content\":\"Clearly explains the situation and the candidate\'s role in the conflict.\",\"order_index\":1,\"created_at\":\"2026-09-17T08:30:41.671Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-09-17T08:30:41.671Z\"},{\"id\":111,\"question_id\":65,\"type\":\"rubric\",\"content\":\"Shows active listening, respectful communication, and problem-solving.\",\"order_index\":2,\"created_at\":\"2026-09-17T08:30:41.672Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-09-17T08:30:41.672Z\"},{\"id\":112,\"question_id\":65,\"type\":\"interview_tip\",\"content\":\"Probe the candidate: What would you do differently if the same conflict happened again?\",\"order_index\":3,\"created_at\":\"2026-09-17T08:30:41.686Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-09-17T08:30:41.686Z\"}],\"created_at\":\"2026-09-17T08:30:41.669Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-09-17T08:30:41.669Z\"},{\"id\":66,\"level_id\":14,\"title\":\"Taking Leadership\",\"prompt\":\"Tell me about a time when you took the initiative to lead a task or activity.\",\"difficulty\":\"Easy\",\"type\":\"verbal_qa\",\"detail\":{\"id\":66,\"question_id\":66,\"constraints\":\"\",\"expected_approach\":\"\",\"expected_complexity\":\"\",\"ideal_answer\":\"Use the STAR format: Situation - describe the task or activity. Task - explain why leadership was needed. Action - explain how you organized the team, assigned responsibilities, and kept everyone involved. Result - describe the outcome and what you learned about leadership.\",\"scenario\":\"\",\"correct_option\":\"\",\"explanation\":\"\",\"created_at\":\"2026-09-17T08:30:41.718Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-09-17T08:30:41.718Z\"},\"hints\":[{\"id\":113,\"question_id\":66,\"type\":\"rubric\",\"content\":\"Provides a specific example where the candidate voluntarily took responsibility.\",\"order_index\":1,\"created_at\":\"2026-09-17T08:30:41.721Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-09-17T08:30:41.721Z\"},{\"id\":114,\"question_id\":66,\"type\":\"rubric\",\"content\":\"Explains how the candidate coordinated or supported other team members.\",\"order_index\":2,\"created_at\":\"2026-09-17T08:30:41.722Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-09-17T08:30:41.722Z\"},{\"id\":115,\"question_id\":66,\"type\":\"interview_tip\",\"content\":\"Probe the candidate: How did you handle a teammate who was not contributing?\",\"order_index\":3,\"created_at\":\"2026-09-17T08:30:41.722Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-09-17T08:30:41.722Z\"}],\"created_at\":\"2026-09-17T08:30:41.714Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-09-17T08:30:41.714Z\"},{\"id\":67,\"level_id\":14,\"title\":\"Handling Failure\",\"prompt\":\"Tell me about a time when you failed at a task or made a mistake. What did you do afterward?\",\"difficulty\":\"Easy\",\"type\":\"verbal_qa\",\"detail\":{\"id\":67,\"question_id\":67,\"constraints\":\"\",\"expected_approach\":\"\",\"expected_complexity\":\"\",\"ideal_answer\":\"Use the STAR format: Situation - explain the task and what went wrong. Task - describe your responsibility. Action - explain how you accepted the mistake, identified the cause, and took corrective action. Result - describe the outcome and the lesson learned.\",\"scenario\":\"\",\"correct_option\":\"\",\"explanation\":\"\",\"created_at\":\"2026-09-17T08:30:41.751Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-09-17T08:30:41.751Z\"},\"hints\":[{\"id\":116,\"question_id\":67,\"type\":\"rubric\",\"content\":\"Takes responsibility instead of blaming others.\",\"order_index\":1,\"created_at\":\"2026-09-17T08:30:41.753Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-09-17T08:30:41.753Z\"},{\"id\":117,\"question_id\":67,\"type\":\"rubric\",\"content\":\"Demonstrates learning and corrective action after the mistake.\",\"order_index\":2,\"created_at\":\"2026-09-17T08:30:41.753Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-09-17T08:30:41.753Z\"},{\"id\":118,\"question_id\":67,\"type\":\"interview_tip\",\"content\":\"Probe the candidate: What specific change did you make after this experience?\",\"order_index\":3,\"created_at\":\"2026-09-17T08:30:41.754Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-09-17T08:30:41.754Z\"}],\"created_at\":\"2026-09-17T08:30:41.748Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-09-17T08:30:41.748Z\"},{\"id\":68,\"level_id\":14,\"title\":\"Working Under Pressure\",\"prompt\":\"Describe a situation where you had to complete an important task under pressure or within a tight deadline.\",\"difficulty\":\"Easy\",\"type\":\"verbal_qa\",\"detail\":{\"id\":68,\"question_id\":68,\"constraints\":\"\",\"expected_approach\":\"\",\"expected_complexity\":\"\",\"ideal_answer\":\"Use the STAR format: Situation - describe the pressure or deadline. Task - explain what needed to be completed. Action - describe how you prioritized work, managed your time, and stayed focused. Result - explain whether you completed the task and what you learned.\",\"scenario\":\"\",\"correct_option\":\"\",\"explanation\":\"\",\"created_at\":\"2026-09-17T08:30:41.776Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-09-17T08:30:41.776Z\"},\"hints\":[{\"id\":119,\"question_id\":68,\"type\":\"rubric\",\"content\":\"Explains how priorities were identified and time was managed.\",\"order_index\":1,\"created_at\":\"2026-09-17T08:30:41.786Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-09-17T08:30:41.786Z\"},{\"id\":120,\"question_id\":68,\"type\":\"rubric\",\"content\":\"Shows calm decision-making and focus under pressure.\",\"order_index\":2,\"created_at\":\"2026-09-17T08:30:41.787Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-09-17T08:30:41.787Z\"},{\"id\":121,\"question_id\":68,\"type\":\"interview_tip\",\"content\":\"Probe the candidate: How did you decide what to do first?\",\"order_index\":3,\"created_at\":\"2026-09-17T08:30:41.788Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-09-17T08:30:41.788Z\"}],\"created_at\":\"2026-09-17T08:30:41.773Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-09-17T08:30:41.773Z\"},{\"id\":69,\"level_id\":14,\"title\":\"Helping a Teammate\",\"prompt\":\"Tell me about a time when you helped a teammate who was struggling with a task.\",\"difficulty\":\"Easy\",\"type\":\"verbal_qa\",\"detail\":{\"id\":69,\"question_id\":69,\"constraints\":\"\",\"expected_approach\":\"\",\"expected_complexity\":\"\",\"ideal_answer\":\"Use the STAR format: Situation - explain why the teammate was struggling. Task - describe your role or responsibility. Action - explain how you understood their problem and provided guidance or support. Result - describe how the teammate or team benefited.\",\"scenario\":\"\",\"correct_option\":\"\",\"explanation\":\"\",\"created_at\":\"2026-09-17T08:30:41.817Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-09-17T08:30:41.817Z\"},\"hints\":[{\"id\":122,\"question_id\":69,\"type\":\"rubric\",\"content\":\"Shows teamwork, empathy, and willingness to support others.\",\"order_index\":1,\"created_at\":\"2026-09-17T08:30:41.834Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-09-17T08:30:41.834Z\"},{\"id\":123,\"question_id\":69,\"type\":\"rubric\",\"content\":\"Explains how the candidate helped without simply doing the work for the teammate.\",\"order_index\":2,\"created_at\":\"2026-09-17T08:30:41.835Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-09-17T08:30:41.835Z\"},{\"id\":124,\"question_id\":69,\"type\":\"interview_tip\",\"content\":\"Probe the candidate: How did you make sure the teammate understood the solution?\",\"order_index\":3,\"created_at\":\"2026-09-17T08:30:41.835Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-09-17T08:30:41.835Z\"}],\"created_at\":\"2026-09-17T08:30:41.815Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-09-17T08:30:41.815Z\"},{\"id\":70,\"level_id\":14,\"title\":\"Making a Difficult Decision\",\"prompt\":\"Tell me about a time when you had to make a difficult decision. How did you decide what to do?\",\"difficulty\":\"Easy\",\"type\":\"verbal_qa\",\"detail\":{\"id\":70,\"question_id\":70,\"constraints\":\"\",\"expected_approach\":\"\",\"expected_complexity\":\"\",\"ideal_answer\":\"Use the STAR format: Situation - explain the difficult situation. Task - describe the decision you were responsible for. Action - explain how you considered the available options, risks, and consequences. Result - describe the outcome and what you learned.\",\"scenario\":\"\",\"correct_option\":\"\",\"explanation\":\"\",\"created_at\":\"2026-09-17T08:30:41.855Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-09-17T08:30:41.855Z\"},\"hints\":[{\"id\":125,\"question_id\":70,\"type\":\"rubric\",\"content\":\"Clearly explains the options and factors considered before making the decision.\",\"order_index\":1,\"created_at\":\"2026-09-17T08:30:41.857Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-09-17T08:30:41.857Z\"},{\"id\":126,\"question_id\":70,\"type\":\"rubric\",\"content\":\"Demonstrates accountability for the final decision.\",\"order_index\":2,\"created_at\":\"2026-09-17T08:30:41.858Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-09-17T08:30:41.858Z\"},{\"id\":127,\"question_id\":70,\"type\":\"interview_tip\",\"content\":\"Probe the candidate: What information was most important when making the decision?\",\"order_index\":3,\"created_at\":\"2026-09-17T08:30:41.863Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-09-17T08:30:41.863Z\"}],\"created_at\":\"2026-09-17T08:30:41.854Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-09-17T08:30:41.854Z\"},{\"id\":71,\"level_id\":14,\"title\":\"Receiving Feedback\",\"prompt\":\"Tell me about a time when you received negative or constructive feedback. How did you respond?\",\"difficulty\":\"Easy\",\"type\":\"verbal_qa\",\"detail\":{\"id\":71,\"question_id\":71,\"constraints\":\"\",\"expected_approach\":\"\",\"expected_complexity\":\"\",\"ideal_answer\":\"Use the STAR format: Situation - describe when you received the feedback. Task - explain what you were responsible for. Action - describe how you listened, understood the feedback, and made improvements. Result - explain how your performance changed afterward.\",\"scenario\":\"\",\"correct_option\":\"\",\"explanation\":\"\",\"created_at\":\"2026-09-17T08:30:41.888Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-09-17T08:30:41.888Z\"},\"hints\":[{\"id\":128,\"question_id\":71,\"type\":\"rubric\",\"content\":\"Shows openness to feedback without becoming defensive.\",\"order_index\":1,\"created_at\":\"2026-09-17T08:30:41.889Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-09-17T08:30:41.889Z\"},{\"id\":129,\"question_id\":71,\"type\":\"rubric\",\"content\":\"Provides a specific improvement made based on the feedback.\",\"order_index\":2,\"created_at\":\"2026-09-17T08:30:41.889Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-09-17T08:30:41.889Z\"},{\"id\":130,\"question_id\":71,\"type\":\"interview_tip\",\"content\":\"Probe the candidate: What was the most useful part of the feedback?\",\"order_index\":3,\"created_at\":\"2026-09-17T08:30:41.89Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-09-17T08:30:41.89Z\"}],\"created_at\":\"2026-09-17T08:30:41.886Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-09-17T08:30:41.886Z\"},{\"id\":72,\"level_id\":14,\"title\":\"Adapting to Change\",\"prompt\":\"Describe a time when a plan changed unexpectedly. How did you adapt?\",\"difficulty\":\"Easy\",\"type\":\"verbal_qa\",\"detail\":{\"id\":72,\"question_id\":72,\"constraints\":\"\",\"expected_approach\":\"\",\"expected_complexity\":\"\",\"ideal_answer\":\"Use the STAR format: Situation - explain the original plan and what changed. Task - describe what you still needed to accomplish. Action - explain how you adjusted your approach and communicated the changes. Result - describe the final outcome.\",\"scenario\":\"\",\"correct_option\":\"\",\"explanation\":\"\",\"created_at\":\"2026-09-17T08:30:41.917Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-09-17T08:30:41.917Z\"},\"hints\":[{\"id\":131,\"question_id\":72,\"type\":\"rubric\",\"content\":\"Clearly explains the unexpected change and its impact.\",\"order_index\":1,\"created_at\":\"2026-09-17T08:30:41.919Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-09-17T08:30:41.919Z\"},{\"id\":132,\"question_id\":72,\"type\":\"rubric\",\"content\":\"Demonstrates flexibility, problem-solving, and communication.\",\"order_index\":2,\"created_at\":\"2026-09-17T08:30:41.919Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-09-17T08:30:41.919Z\"},{\"id\":133,\"question_id\":72,\"type\":\"interview_tip\",\"content\":\"Probe the candidate: How did you communicate the changed plan to others?\",\"order_index\":3,\"created_at\":\"2026-09-17T08:30:41.92Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-09-17T08:30:41.92Z\"}],\"created_at\":\"2026-09-17T08:30:41.915Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-09-17T08:30:41.915Z\"},{\"id\":73,\"level_id\":14,\"title\":\"Motivating Others\",\"prompt\":\"Tell me about a time when you helped motivate your team to complete an important task.\",\"difficulty\":\"Easy\",\"type\":\"verbal_qa\",\"detail\":{\"id\":73,\"question_id\":73,\"constraints\":\"\",\"expected_approach\":\"\",\"expected_complexity\":\"\",\"ideal_answer\":\"Use the STAR format: Situation - describe why the team was losing motivation. Task - explain your responsibility. Action - describe how you encouraged the team, clarified goals, divided work, or supported teammates. Result - explain how the team\'s motivation and progress improved.\",\"scenario\":\"\",\"correct_option\":\"\",\"explanation\":\"\",\"created_at\":\"2026-09-17T08:30:41.951Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-09-17T08:30:41.951Z\"},\"hints\":[{\"id\":134,\"question_id\":73,\"type\":\"rubric\",\"content\":\"Shows positive communication and understanding of team members.\",\"order_index\":1,\"created_at\":\"2026-09-17T08:30:41.953Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-09-17T08:30:41.953Z\"},{\"id\":135,\"question_id\":73,\"type\":\"rubric\",\"content\":\"Explains specific actions taken to improve team motivation.\",\"order_index\":2,\"created_at\":\"2026-09-17T08:30:41.953Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-09-17T08:30:41.953Z\"},{\"id\":136,\"question_id\":73,\"type\":\"interview_tip\",\"content\":\"Probe the candidate: How did you know your approach was working?\",\"order_index\":3,\"created_at\":\"2026-09-17T08:30:41.954Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-09-17T08:30:41.954Z\"}],\"created_at\":\"2026-09-17T08:30:41.943Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-09-17T08:30:41.943Z\"},{\"id\":74,\"level_id\":14,\"title\":\"Taking Responsibility\",\"prompt\":\"Tell me about a time when you were responsible for a problem in a team project. What did you do?\",\"difficulty\":\"Easy\",\"type\":\"verbal_qa\",\"detail\":{\"id\":74,\"question_id\":74,\"constraints\":\"\",\"expected_approach\":\"\",\"expected_complexity\":\"\",\"ideal_answer\":\"Use the STAR format: Situation - explain the team project and the problem. Task - describe your responsibility. Action - explain how you acknowledged the issue, communicated with the team, and worked on a solution. Result - describe the final outcome and what you learned about accountability.\",\"scenario\":\"\",\"correct_option\":\"\",\"explanation\":\"\",\"created_at\":\"2026-09-17T08:30:41.972Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-09-17T08:30:41.972Z\"},\"hints\":[{\"id\":137,\"question_id\":74,\"type\":\"rubric\",\"content\":\"Accepts responsibility and avoids blaming teammates.\",\"order_index\":1,\"created_at\":\"2026-09-17T08:30:41.973Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-09-17T08:30:41.973Z\"},{\"id\":138,\"question_id\":74,\"type\":\"rubric\",\"content\":\"Shows ownership, communication, and corrective action.\",\"order_index\":2,\"created_at\":\"2026-09-17T08:30:41.974Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-09-17T08:30:41.974Z\"},{\"id\":139,\"question_id\":74,\"type\":\"interview_tip\",\"content\":\"Probe the candidate: What did you learn about taking ownership from this experience?\",\"order_index\":3,\"created_at\":\"2026-09-17T08:30:41.975Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-09-17T08:30:41.975Z\"}],\"created_at\":\"2026-09-17T08:30:41.971Z\",\"updated_at\