er_agent\":\"Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/153.0.0.0 Safari/537.36\",\"status_code\":200,\"latency_ms\":26,\"request_body\":\"\",\"response_body\":\"{\\\"data\\\":[{\\\"id\\\":65,\\\"level_id\\\":14,\\\"title\\\":\\\"Handling a Team Conflict\\\",\\\"prompt\\\":\\\"Tell me about a time when you had a disagreement or conflict with a teammate. How did you handle the situation?\\\",\\\"difficulty\\\":\\\"Easy\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"verbal_qa\\\",\\\"detail\\\":{\\\"id\\\":65,\\\"question_id\\\":65,\\\"constraints\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"expected_approach\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"expected_complexity\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"ideal_answer\\\":\\\"Use the STAR format: Situation - describe the disagreement briefly. Task - explain your responsibility in resolving it. Action - describe how you listened, communicated calmly, and worked toward a solution. Result - explain how the conflict was resolved and what you learned.\\\",\\\"scenario\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"correct_option\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"explanation\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"created_at\\\":\\\"2026-09-17T08:30:41.67Z\\\",\\\"updated_at\\\":\\\"2026-09-17T08:30:41.67Z\\\"},\\\"hints\\\":[{\\\"id\\\":110,\\\"question_id\\\":65,\\\"type\\\":\\\"rubric\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"Clearly explains the situation and the candidate\'s role in the conflict.\\\",\\\"order_index\\\":1,\\\"created_at\\\":\\\"2026-09-17T08:30:41.671Z\\\",\\\"updated_at\\\":\\\"2026-09-17T08:30:41.671Z\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":111,\\\"question_id\\\":65,\\\"type\\\":\\\"rubric\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"Shows active listening, respectful communication, and problem-solving.\\\",\\\"order_index\\\":2,\\\"created_at\\\":\\\"2026-09-17T08:30:41.672Z\\\",\\\"updated_at\\\":\\\"2026-09-17T08:30:41.672Z\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":112,\\\"question_id\\\":65,\\\"type\\\":\\\"interview_tip\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"Probe the candidate: What would you do differently if the same conflict happened again?\\\",\\\"order_index\\\":3,\\\"created_at\\\":\\\"2026-09-17T08:30:41.686Z\\\",\\\"updated_at\\\":\\\"2026-09-17T08:30:41.686Z\\\"}],\\\"created_at\\\":\\\"2026-09-17T08:30:41.669Z\\\",\\\"updated_at\\\":\\\"2026-09-17T08:30:41.669Z\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":66,\\\"level_id\\\":14,\\\"title\\\":\\\"Taking Leadership\\\",\\\"prompt\\\":\\\"Tell me about a time when you took the initiative to lead a task or activity.\\\",\\\"difficulty\\\":\\\"Easy\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"verbal_qa\\\",\\\"detail\\\":{\\\"id\\\":66,\\\"question_id\\\":66,\\\"constraints\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"expected_approach\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"expected_complexity\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"ideal_answer\\\":\\\"Use the STAR format: Situation - describe the task or activity. Task - explain why leadership was needed. Action - explain how you organized the team, assigned responsibilities, and kept everyone involved. Result - describe the outcome and what you learned about leadership.\\\",\\\"scenario\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"correct_option\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"explanation\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"created_at\\\":\\\"2026-09-17T08:30:41.718Z\\\",\\\"updated_at\\\":\\\"2026-09-17T08:30:41.718Z\\\"},\\\"hints\\\":[{\\\"id\\\":113,\\\"question_id\\\":66,\\\"type\\\":\\\"rubric\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"Provides a specific example where the candidate voluntarily took responsibility.\\\",\\\"order_index\\\":1,\\\"created_at\\\":\\\"2026-09-17T08:30:41.721Z\\\",\\\"updated_at\\\":\\\"2026-09-17T08:30:41.721Z\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":114,\\\"question_id\\\":66,\\\"type\\\":\\\"rubric\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"Explains how the candidate coordinated or supported other team members.\\\",\\\"order_index\\\":2,\\\"created_at\\\":\\\"2026-09-17T08:30:41.722Z\\\",\\\"updated_at\\\":\\\"2026-09-17T08:30:41.722Z\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":115,\\\"question_id\\\":66,\\\"type\\\":\\\"interview_tip\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"Probe the candidate: How did you handle a teammate who was not contributing?\\\",\\\"order_index\\\":3,\\\"created_at\\\":\\\"2026-09-17T08:30:41.722Z\\\",\\\"updated_at\\\":\\\"2026-09-17T08:30:41.722Z\\\"}],\\\"created_at\\\":\\\"2026-09-17T08:30:41.714Z\\\",\\\"updated_at\\\":\\\"2026-09-17T08:30:41.714Z\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":67,\\\"level_id\\\":14,\\\"title\\\":\\\"Handling Failure\\\",\\\"prompt\\\":\\\"Tell me about a time when you failed at a task or made a mistake. What did you do afterward?\\\",\\\"difficulty\\\":\\\"Easy\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"verbal_qa\\\",\\\"detail\\\":{\\\"id\\\":67,\\\"question_id\\\":67,\\\"constraints\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"expected_approach\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"expected_complexity\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"ideal_answer\\\":\\\"Use the STAR format: Situation - explain the task and what went wrong. Task - describe your responsibility. Action - explain how you accepted the mistake, identified the cause, and took corrective action. Result - describe the outcome and the lesson learned.\\\",\\\"scenario\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"correct_option\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"explanation\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"created_at\\\":\\\"2026-09-17T08:30:41.751Z\\\",\\\"updated_at\\\":\\\"2026-09-17T08:30:41.751Z\\\"},\\\"hints\\\":[{\\\"id\\\":116,\\\"question_id\\\":67,\\\"type\\\":\\\"rubric\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"Takes responsibility instead of blaming others.\\\",\\\"order_index\\\":1,\\\"created_at\\\":\\\"2026-09-17T08:30:41.753Z\\\",\\\"updated_at\\\":\\\"2026-09-17T08:30:41.753Z\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":117,\\\"question_id\\\":67,\\\"type\\\":\\\"rubric\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"Demonstrates learning and corrective action after the mistake.\\\",\\\"order_index\\\":2,\\\"created_at\\\":\\\"2026-09-17T08:30:41.753Z\\\",\\\"updated_at\\\":\\\"2026-09-17T08:30:41.753Z\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":118,\\\"question_id\\\":67,\\\"type\\\":\\\"interview_tip\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"Probe the candidate: What specific change did you make after this experience?\\\",\\\"order_index\\\":3,\\\"created_at\\\":\\\"2026-09-17T08:30:41.754Z\\\",\\\"updated_at\\\":\\\"2026-09-17T08:30:41.754Z\\\"}],\\\"created_at\\\":\\\"2026-09-17T08:30:41.748Z\\\",\\\"updated_at\\\":\\\"2026-09-17T08:30:41.748Z\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":68,\\\"level_id\\\":14,\\\"title\\\":\\\"Working Under Pressure