 solving, arrays, trees, dynamic programming, and algorithmic complexity.\",\"created_at\":\"2026-09-17T07:43:11Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-09-17T07:43:11Z\"},\"track_id\":1}},\"status\":\"success\"}','','2026-09-17 08:59:12.594'),(604,4,'jagaprasanths.cs25@bitsathy.ac.in','JagaPrasanth S','student','GET','/api/v1/interviews/sessions/1','','2a09:bac1:3680:128::29e:38','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/153.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',200,11,'','{\"data\":{\"current_user_role\":\"interviewee\",\"peer\":{\"name\":\"Peer Interviewer\",\"roll_no\":\"INTERVIEWER\",\"department\":\"Student Assessor\"},\"session\":{\"candidate_code\":\"// Write your solution here\\n\",\"candidate_lang\":\"javascript\",\"candidate_whiteboard\":\"\",\"current_question\":{\"created_at\":\"2026-09-17T07:52:40.307Z\",\"detail\":{\"id\":9,\"question_id\":9,\"constraints\":\"1 \\u003c= N \\u003c= 10^5\\n-10^4 \\u003c= nums[i] \\u003c= 10^4\\n-10^9 \\u003c= K \\u003c= 10^9\\nTime Limit: 2.0s\\nMemory Limit: 256MB\",\"expected_approach\":\"Maintain a running prefix sum and use a HashMap to store the frequency of previous prefix sums. For the current sum S, look for S - K.\",\"expected_complexity\":\"Time: O(N), Space: O(N)\",\"ideal_answer\":\"\",\"scenario\":\"\",\"correct_option\":\"\",\"explanation\":\"\",\"created_at\":\"2026-09-17T07:52:40.316Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-09-17T07:52:40.316Z\"},\"difficulty\":\"Medium\",\"id\":9,\"level_id\":1,\"mcq_options\":null,\"options\":null,\"payload\":{\"constraints\":\"1 \\u003c= N \\u003c= 10^5\\n-10^4 \\u003c= nums[i] \\u003c= 10^4\\n-10^9 \\u003c= K \\u003c= 10^9\\nTime Limit: 2.0s\\nMemory Limit: 256MB\",\"open_test_cases\":[{\"explanation\":\"\",\"input\":\"3\\n1 1 1\\n2\",\"output\":\"2\"}],\"options\":null,\"scenario\":\"\",\"starter_code\":\"\",\"starter_code_cpp\":\"\",\"starter_code_java\":\"\",\"starter_code_js\":\"\",\"starter_code_py\":\"\"},\"prompt\":\"Given an integer array and an integer K, cou