:52:40.328Z\"}],\"hints\":[{\"id\":17,\"question_id\":9,\"type\":\"hint\",\"content\":\"Think about prefix sums and what previous sum would be needed to produce K.\",\"order_index\":1,\"created_at\":\"2026-09-17T07:52:40.334Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-09-17T07:52:40.334Z\"},{\"id\":18,\"question_id\":9,\"type\":\"interview_tip\",\"content\":\"Ask why a normal sliding-window approach does not work when negative numbers are present.\",\"order_index\":2,\"created_at\":\"2026-09-17T07:52:40.335Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-09-17T07:52:40.335Z\"}],\"created_at\":\"2026-09-17T07:52:40.307Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-09-17T07:52:40.307Z\"},{\"id\":10,\"level_id\":1,\"title\":\"Valid Parentheses\",\"prompt\":\"Given a string containing only (), {}, and [], determine whether the brackets are valid. Every opening bracket must have the correct closing bracket, and brackets must close in the correct order.\",\"difficulty\":\"Easy\",\"type\":\"coding\",\"detail\":{\"id\":10,\"question_id\":10,\"constraints\":\"1 \\u003c= s.length \\u003c= 10^5\\ns contains only (, ), {, }, [, ].\\nTime Limit: 2.0s\\nMemory Limit: 256MB\",\"expected_approach\":\"Use a stack to store opening brackets and verify that every closing bracket matches the most recently opened bracket.\",\"expected_complexity\":\"Time: O(N), Space: O(N)\",\"ideal_answer\":\"\",\"scenario\":\"\",\"correct_option\":\"\",\"explanation\":\"\",\"created_at\":\"2026-09-17T07:52:40.382Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-09-17T07:52:40.382Z\"},\"test_cases\":[{\"id\":19,\"question_id\":10,\"input\":\"{[()]}\",\"expected_output\":\"true\",\"is_hidden\":false,\"explanation\":\"\",\"order_index\":1,\"created_at\":\"2026-09-17T07:52:40.388Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-09-17T07:52:40.388Z\"},{\"id\":20,\"question_id\":10,\"input\":\"([)]\",\"expected_output\":\"false\",\"is_hidden\":true,\"explanation\":\"\",\"order_index\":2,\"created_at\":\"2026-09-17T07:52:40.395Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-09-17T07:52:40.395Z\"}],\"hints\":[{\"id\":19,\"question_id\":10,\