: 256MB\",\"expected_approach\":\"Use a stack to store opening brackets and verify that every closing bracket matches the most recently opened bracket.\",\"expected_complexity\":\"Time: O(N), Space: O(N)\",\"ideal_answer\":\"\",\"scenario\":\"\",\"correct_option\":\"\",\"explanation\":\"\",\"created_at\":\"2026-09-17T07:52:40.382Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-09-17T07:52:40.382Z\"},\"test_cases\":[{\"id\":19,\"question_id\":10,\"input\":\"{[()]}\",\"expected_output\":\"true\",\"is_hidden\":false,\"explanation\":\"\",\"order_index\":1,\"created_at\":\"2026-09-17T07:52:40.388Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-09-17T07:52:40.388Z\"},{\"id\":20,\"question_id\":10,\"input\":\"([)]\",\"expected_output\":\"false\",\"is_hidden\":true,\"explanation\":\"\",\"order_index\":2,\"created_at\":\"2026-09-17T07:52:40.395Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-09-17T07:52:40.395Z\"}],\"hints\":[{\"id\":19,\"question_id\":10,\"type\":\"hint\",\"content\":\"The most recently opened bracket must be closed first.\",\"order_index\":1,\"created_at\":\"2026-09-17T07:52:40.401Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-09-17T07:52:40.401Z\"},{\"id\":20,\"question_id\":10,\"type\":\"interview_tip\",\"content\":\"Ask why a stack is suitable for this problem and what happens when a closing bracket appears with an empty stack.\",\"order_index\":2,\"created_at\":\"2026-09-17T07:52:40.402Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-09-17T07:52:40.402Z\"}],\"created_at\":\"2026-09-17T07:52:40.371Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-09-17T07:52:40.371Z\"}],\"created_at\":\"2026-09-17T07:44:11Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-09-17T07:44:25.437Z\"},\"level_id\":1,\"level_questions\":[{\"created_at\":\"2026-09-17T07:52:39.705Z\",\"detail\":{\"id\":1,\"question_id\":1,\"constraints\":\"2 \\u003c= N \\u003c= 10^5\\n-10^9 \\u003c= nums[i] \\u003c= 10^9\\nExactly one valid answer exists.\\nTime Limit: 2.0s\\nMemory Limit: 256MB\",\"expected_approach\":\"Traverse the array once and use a HashMap to store previously visited numbers and their indices. For each number, check whether target -