amming \\u0026 Optimization\",\"description\":\"State transitions, memoization, and hard algorithmic challenges\",\"mode\":\"coding\",\"duration_minutes\":60,\"question_count\":1,\"questions_count\":0}]},{\"id\":2,\"title\":\"System Design \\u0026 Architecture\",\"slug\":\"system-design\",\"category\":\"Architecture\",\"icon\":\"Layers\",\"description\":\"Scalable distributed systems, load balancers, caching, microservices, and whiteboard diagrams.\",\"levels_count\":2,\"questions_count\":10,\"levels\":[{\"id\":4,\"track_id\":2,\"level_number\":1,\"name\":\"High-Level System Design\",\"description\":\"Designing scalable URL shorteners, rate limiters, and cache layers\",\"mode\":\"whiteboard\",\"duration_minutes\":45,\"question_count\":1,\"questions_count\":10},{\"id\":5,\"track_id\":2,\"level_number\":2,\"name\":\"Large-Scale Distributed Systems\",\"description\":\"Designing YouTube, Uber, or messaging systems with partitioning and CAP theorem\",\"mode\":\"whiteboard\",\"duration_minutes\":60,\"question_count\":1,\"questions_count\":0}]},{\"id\":3,\"title\":\"Database Engineering \\u0026 SQL\",\"slug\":\"database-engineering\",\"category\":\"Databases\",\"icon\":\"Database\",\"description\":\"Interactive SQL playground, schema design, indexes, transactions, and query optimization.\",\"levels_count\":2,\"questions_count\":5,\"levels\":[{\"id\":6,\"track_id\":3,\"level_number\":1,\"name\":\"Relational Queries \\u0026 Complex Joins\",\"description\":\"Interactive SQL playground: aggregations, subqueries, and window functions\",\"mode\":\"database\",\"duration_minutes\":45,\"question_count\":1,\"questions_count\":5},{\"id\":7,\"track_id\":3,\"level_number\":2,\"name\":\"Schema Design \\u0026 Query Optimization\",\"description\":\"Indexing strategies, query execution plans, and transaction isolation\",\"mode\":\"database\",\"duration_minutes\":50,\"question_count\":1,\"questions_count\":0}]},{\"id\":4,\"title\":\"Frontend \\u0026 Web Development\",\"slug\":\"frontend-dev