termine whether they are anagrams of each other. Two strings are anagrams if they contain exactly the same characters with the same frequencies.\",\"difficulty\":\"Easy\",\"type\":\"coding\",\"created_at\":\"2026-09-17T07:52:39.811Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-09-17T07:52:39.811Z\"},{\"id\":3,\"level_id\":1,\"title\":\"First Non-Repeating Character\",\"prompt\":\"Given a string, find the index of the first character that appears exactly once. If no such character exists, print -1.\",\"difficulty\":\"Easy\",\"type\":\"coding\",\"created_at\":\"2026-09-17T07:52:39.891Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-09-17T07:52:39.891Z\"},{\"id\":4,\"level_id\":1,\"title\":\"Group Anagrams\",\"prompt\":\"Given N strings, group strings that are anagrams of each other. Print each group on a separate line. Words within each group should remain in their original input order.\",\"difficulty\":\"Medium\",\"type\":\"coding\",\"created_at\":\"2026-09-17T07:52:39.974Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-09-17T07:52:39.974Z\"},{\"id\":5,\"level_id\":1,\"title\":\"Longest Substring Without Repeating Characters\",\"prompt\":\"Given a string, find the length of the longest substring that contains no repeated characters.\",\"difficulty\":\"Medium\",\"type\":\"coding\",\"created_at\":\"2026-09-17T07:52:40.051Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-09-17T07:52:40.051Z\"},{\"id\":6,\"level_id\":1,\"title\":\"Majority Element\",\"prompt\":\"Given an array of integers, find the element that appears more than N/2 times. A majority element is guaranteed to exist.\",\"difficulty\":\"Easy\",\"type\":\"coding\",\"created_at\":\"2026-09-17T07:52:40.12Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-09-17T07:52:40.12Z\"},{\"id\":7,\"level_id\":1,\"title\":\"Longest Consecutive Sequence\",\"prompt\":\"Given an unsorted array of integers, find the length of the longest sequence of consecutive integers. The elements do not need to appear next to each other in the input array.\",\"difficulty\":\"Medium\",\"type\":\"coding\",\"created_at\":\"2026-09-17T07:52:40.194Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-09-17T07:52:40.194Z\"},{\"id\":8,\"level_id\":1,\"title\":\"Product of Array Except Self\",\"prompt\":\"Given an integer array, return an array where each position contains the product of every element except the element at that position. Division is not allowed.\",\"difficulty\":\"Medium\",\"type\":\"coding\",\"created_at\":\"2026-09-17T07:52:40.252Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-09-17T07:52:40.252Z\"},{\"id\":9,\"level_id\":1,\"title\":\"Subarray Sum Equals K\",\"prompt\":\"Given an integer array and an integer K, count the number of contiguous subarrays whose sum equals K.\",\"difficulty\":\"Medium\",\"type\":\"coding\",\"created_at\":\"2026-09-17T07:52:40.307Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-09-17T07:52:40.307Z\"},{\"id\":10,\"level_id\":1,\"title\":\"Valid Parentheses\",\"prompt\":\"Given a string containing only (), {}, and [], determine whether the brackets are valid. Every opening bracket must have the correct closing bracket, and brackets must close in the correct order.\",\"difficulty\":\"Easy\",\"type\":\"coding\",\"created_at\":\"2026-09-17T07:52:40.371Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-09-17T07:52:40.371Z\"}],\"created_at\":\"2026-09-17T07:44:11Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-09-17T07:44:25.437Z\"},\"interviewer_id\":4,\"interviewer\":{\"id\":4,\"name\":\"JagaPrasanth S\",\"email\":\"jagaprasanths.cs25@bitsathy.ac.in\",\"roll_no\":\"7376251CS219\",\"department\":\"CSE\",\"role\":\"student\",\"last_login_at\":\"2026-09-17T09:22:02.127Z\",\"has_active_session\":false,\"created_at\":\"2026-09-17T06:56:38.831Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-09-17T09:22:02.128Z\"},\"interviewee_id\":3,\"interviewee\":{\"id\":3,\"name\":\"Jaison David M\",\"email\":\"jaisondavidm.cs25@bitsathy.ac.in\",\"roll_no\":\"7376251CS221\",\"department\":\"CSE\",\"role\":\"student\",\"last_login_at\":\"2026-09-17T09:24:47.84Z\",\"has_active_session\":false,\"created_at\":\"2026-09-17T06:56:03.26Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-09-17T09:26:23.895Z\"},\"status\":\"completed\",\"round\":1,\"current_question_id\":7