hink about counting frequencies with a HashMap.\",\"order_index\":1,\"created_at\":\"2026-09-17T07:52:40.155Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-09-17T07:52:40.155Z\"},{\"id\":12,\"question_id\":6,\"type\":\"interview_tip\",\"content\":\"Ask whether the candidate can reduce the auxiliary space to O(1).\",\"order_index\":2,\"created_at\":\"2026-09-17T07:52:40.162Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-09-17T07:52:40.162Z\"}],\"created_at\":\"2026-09-17T07:52:40.12Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-09-17T07:52:40.12Z\"},{\"id\":7,\"level_id\":1,\"title\":\"Longest Consecutive Sequence\",\"prompt\":\"Given an unsorted array of integers, find the length of the longest sequence of consecutive integers. The elements do not need to appear next to each other in the input array.\",\"difficulty\":\"Medium\",\"type\":\"coding\",\"detail\":{\"id\":7,\"question_id\":7,\"constraints\":\"0 \\u003c= N \\u003c= 10^5\\n-10^9 \\u003c= nums[i] \\u003c= 10^9\\nDuplicate values may exist.\\nTime Limit: 2.0s\\nMemory Limit: 256MB\",\"expected_approach\":\"Insert all values into a HashSet. Start counting a sequence only when the current value has no predecessor, then repeatedly check for the next consecutive value.\",\"expected_complexity\":\"Time: O(N) average, Space: O(N)\",\"ideal_answer\":\"\",\"scenario\":\"\",\"correct_option\":\"\",\"explanation\":\"\",\"created_at\":\"2026-09-17T07:52:40.2Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-09-17T07:52:40.2Z\"},\"test_cases\":[{\"id\":13,\"question_id\":7,\"input\":\"6\\n100 4 200 1 3 2\",\"expected_output\":\"4\",\"is_hidden\":false,\"explanation\":\"\",\"order_index\":1,\"created_at\":\"2026-09-17T07:52:40.206Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-09-17T07:52:40.206Z\"},{\"id\":14,\"question_id\":7,\"input\":\"8\\n0 3 7 2 5 8 4 6\",\"expected_output\":\"7\",\"is_hidden\":true,\"explanation\":\"\",\"order_index\":2,\"created_at\":\"2026-09-17T07:52:40.212Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-09-17T07:52:40.212Z\"}],\"hints\":[{\"id\":13,\"question_id\":7,\"type\":\"hint\",\"content\":\"Try putting all numbers into 