ut how to count the frequency of each character.\"],\"ideal_answer\":\"\",\"interview_tips\":[\"Ask whether sorting both strings is necessary and what its complexity would be.\"],\"open_test_cases\":[{\"explanation\":\"\",\"input\":\"anagram\\nnagaram\",\"output\":\"true\"}],\"options\":null,\"rubrics\":null,\"scenario\":\"\",\"starter_code\":\"\",\"starter_code_cpp\":\"\",\"starter_code_java\":\"\",\"starter_code_js\":\"\",\"starter_code_py\":\"\",\"talking_points\":null,\"tradeoffs\":null},\"prompt\":\"Given two strings, determine whether they are anagrams of each other. Two strings are anagrams if they contain exactly the same characters with the same frequencies.\",\"rubrics\":null,\"talking_points\":null,\"templates\":[],\"test_cases\":[{\"explanation\":\"\",\"input\":\"anagram\\nnagaram\",\"output\":\"true\"}],\"title\":\"Valid Anagram\",\"tradeoffs\":null,\"type\":\"coding\"}],\"roles_switched\":true,\"round\":2,\"started_at\":\"2026-09-17T09:28:12.953Z\",\"status\":\"in_progress\",\"switch_count\":1,\"switch_requested_by\":0,\"track\":{\"id\":1,\"title\":\"Data Structures \\u0026 Algorithms\",\"slug\":\"dsa\",\"category\":\"Technical\",\"icon\":\"Code\",\"description\":\"Core problem solving, arrays, trees, dynamic programming, and algorithmic complexity.\",\"created_at\":\"2026-09-17T07:43:11Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-09-17T07:43:11Z\"},\"track_id\":1}},\"status\":\"success\"}','','2026-09-17 09:36:38.306'),(1774,3,'jaisondavidm.cs25@bitsathy.ac.in','Jaison David M','student','POST','/api/v1/interviews/sessions/5/recording/chunk','','2a09:bac1:3680:128::29e:38','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/153.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',200,22,'[Multipart Form Data - Content-Length: 48731 bytes]','{\"bytes_written\":48317,\"message\":\"Audio chunk streamed and stored on server\",\"recording_id\":5,\"sequence_number\":165,\"status\":\"success\",\"total_file_size\":8059055}','','2026-09-17 09:36:38.636');
